{"3594050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "混乱纷争", "steam_appid": 3594050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《混乱纷争》是一款即时战略策略游戏。每次开始游戏前，有多样的种族选</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras/15107859ba0e3928a51c2498ca62e4f2.avif?t=1746074157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras_big/15107859ba0e3928a51c2498ca62e4f2.avif?t=1746074157 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >进入战斗后，通过对战局的观察进行升级科技强化你的士兵，危难时刻在基地释放种族魔法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras/e5e878ee1c093318c077693d911dabae.avif?t=1746074157\" width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过升级兵营训练更多的士兵为你战斗，欣赏他们战斗的场景</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras/0c62c76643cd5a7247fc03749303a23c.avif?t=1746074157\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在完成对局后，获得新的装备来提升自己，然后继续征战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《混乱纷争》是一款即时战略策略游戏。每次开始游戏前，有多样的种族选</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras/15107859ba0e3928a51c2498ca62e4f2.avif?t=1746074157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594050/extras_big/15107859ba0e3928a51c2498ca62e4f2.avif?t=1746074157 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >进入战斗后，通过对战局的观察进行升级科技强化你的士兵，危难时刻在基地释放种族魔法</p><p class